+// Replaces useDockState (timers, two hold counts, click-away) and
+// useDockClickIntegrity (the settle-window click guard). Every edge is a row of
+// TABLE; the O-59 / R4-01 rows are edges, not gates:
+//   R4-01-05  click.away is accepted in every rung, morph or not.
+//   R4-01-06  layer.close re-reads present state (:hover, :focus-within), it never
+//             schedules a collapse as though the pointer had left.
+//   R4-01-15  hover.fine comes from a fine pointer only; a coarse press is its own
+//             input (press.coarse) and its click is swallowed on a folded rung.
+//   UIA-F-10/-11  holds are counted per dock; held never times out.
